{"version":1,"content":"<p>據江蘇海思（HISIGK）官方披露，其11月迎來集中出貨節點，一批全自動雙面對準光刻機完成調試並整裝待發。本次交付覆蓋12寸、8寸、6寸多尺寸平台，分別發往日本MEMS製造企業、AR光波導頭部企業及LED晶片企業。</p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/tech/1585756.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-11-10T12:20:23.113757+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":112,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-10T06:45:52+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-10T12:13:47.084728+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-10T12:13:47.084728+00:00","content_hash":"b0e12911a2205b111c9f271fa15b91fecc333af7cdd87b56a18332335fc7d144","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}